Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.53,0:01:56.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olin-{\i1}san{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.46,0:02:09.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olin'in de Big Mom'dan aşağı kalır yanı yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.84,0:02:17.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dişli, yaşlı bir kadın!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.32,0:02:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O sadece "yaşlı bir kadın" değil.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.24,0:02:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O bir...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.95,0:02:39.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yonko!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.22,0:02:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle... Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.10,0:03:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.73,0:03:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalk, seni lanet kertenkele!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.40,0:03:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur artık, seni kocakarı!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.70,0:03:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim olduğumu sanıyorsun sen?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.07,0:03:43.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.75,0:03:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana {\i1}oshiruko{\i0}'mu ver!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.38,0:03:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.20,0:04:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ver artık!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.42,0:04:13.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eğil, ihtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.03,0:04:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,U-Udon...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.36,0:04:42.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon tehlikede!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şükürer olsun, kurtuldular.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.76,0:05:05.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, iyi misiniz?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.11,0:05:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}! Kendinize gelin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.74,0:05:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bayıldı...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.04,0:05:35.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,1,3 milyarlık adamı\Ntopu topu iki vuruşta devirdi!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.80,0:05:44.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tatlı {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} kokusu gitgide artıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.85,0:05:47.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen'i terlemeden paket etti!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.81,0:05:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamen ayrı bir seviyede...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.31,0:05:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yonko Big Mom dedikleri bu mu yani?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.48,0:05:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durumu Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}'a rapor etmeliyiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.40,0:05:59.82,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Açılmayan hücre parçalanmış!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.66,0:06:08.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçeride ne olduğunu bilmiyorum...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.54,0:06:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama zincirli olduğuna eminim.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.95,0:06:15.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçacak yeri olmadığına göre,\Nmuhtemelen ölmüştür.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.49,0:06:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı. Onigashima'ya acilen rapor ediyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.28,0:06:43.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu taraftan {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} kokusu alıyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.36,0:06:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babanuki-{\i1}san{\i0}, ateş etmek için izin istiyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.03,0:06:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin! Embesil gibi\Nonu kışkırtmaya kalkmayın.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-san'ın emirleri nedir?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.50,0:06:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Müdürüm, bir problemimiz var!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.71,0:06:58.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,AAGOZ'lardan sinyal alamıyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.09,0:07:00.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima ile kimse iletişime geçemiyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.46,0:07:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oluyor lan?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.60,0:07:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çıkan tantana sayesinde dikkati elden bıraktılar.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.14,0:07:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Caribou'nun da bunda rolü büyük.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.40,0:07:23.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani tüm olay; "Oraya gitti" veya "Burada" demekten ibaret.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.94,0:07:27.86,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sürekli irtibat hâlinde olmaları tam bir bela!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.86,0:07:32.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelelim en önemli noktaya.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.87,0:07:35.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bakın...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.71,0:07:41.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun akıllı aktarıcı salyangozları,\Nzayıf sinyalleri yüzünden dezavantajlı!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.67,0:07:45.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bunu çözmek için, her AAGOZ...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.34,0:07:50.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}sinyalini önce o bölgedeki\Naktarıcı salyangoz patronuna gönderir..
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.89,0:07:56.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Patron salyangoz da bu sinyali alıcı AAGOZ'lara iletip döngüyü devam ettirir.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.12,0:07:59.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh? Nasıl çalıştığını anladım ama...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.44,0:08:02.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ama, kalın kafalılık etme!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.82,0:08:08.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon'un aktarıcı salyangoz patronunu löp diye yutarsam...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.41,0:08:12.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,sence ne olur?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.04,0:08:18.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani tüm Udon bölgesinin iletişimi kesilecek mi diyorsun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.09,0:08:27.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunca zaman burada boşuna kilitli kalmadım.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.88,0:08:33.60,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Aktarıcı salyangoz patronunun yerini biliyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.64,0:08:35.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Harbi mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.81,0:08:43.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(4733,5640,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}İletişimi kesme işini bana bırak!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.57,0:08:50.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Planımızın kilidi olan anahtarlarsız olmaz,\Ngit de hepsini yürüt, Raizo-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.57,0:08:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dayan, Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.53,0:08:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakında seni özgür bırakacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.16,0:09:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buldum!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.01,0:09:09.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu koku!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.38,0:09:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç şüphe yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.93,0:09:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu {\i1}oshiruko{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.43,0:09:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar tatlı ve lezzetli kokuyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.35,0:09:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca ne kadar da çok varmış!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.77,0:09:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle bu yolculuğa değdi!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi bakalım...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.65,0:09:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babanuki-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.59,0:09:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilmeniz gereken mühim bir mevzu var!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.78,0:09:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne? Bekleyemez mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.79,0:09:39.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} kazanı bomboş!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.46,0:09:43.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne demek bomboş?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.96,0:09:49.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yemek zaafını düşünürsek,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.30,0:09:51.86,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}oshiruko{\i0}'nun bittiğini öğrenince ne yapar?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.86,0:09:56.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Öfkesini kime yöneltecek?!\NMuhtemelen hepimizi öldürür!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.85,0:10:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.10,0:10:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm birimler, burayı hemen terk edin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.08,0:10:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canınızı kurtarın!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.54,0:10:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öngörülemeyen bir felaket kapımıza dayandı!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.07,0:10:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıçayım! Hangi gerzek hepsini yedi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.18,0:10:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek öyle. Canı sadece biraz {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} çekmiş.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.66,0:10:46.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hislerini anlıyorum.\NBen de biraz daha yemek isterdim.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.00,0:10:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} gerçekten çok lezzetliydi!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.89,0:10:57.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bay Hasır Şapka!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.77,0:11:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.45,0:11:03.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Demek... Demek...\N– Demek... Demek...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.66,0:11:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek suçlusu...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ...sensin!\N– ...sensin!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.71,0:11:11.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden herkes bana bakıyor?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bekle, ne? Az önce...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.22,0:11:17.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}oshiruko{\i0}'yu yediğini herkese duyurdun!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.26,0:11:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu sesli mi söyledim?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.31,0:11:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0} cidden çok lezzetliydi"\Ndiye düşünmüştüm...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.85,0:11:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kalkıp bunu sesli {\i1}söylemeyecektim{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.41,0:11:28.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine söyledin. İyi misin sen?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.69,0:11:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffytaro-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.44,0:11:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam da seni bulmuştum, Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.57,0:11:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama yine kendini bir belanın içine soktun!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.91,0:11:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.54,0:11:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm {\i1}oshiruko{\i0}'yu...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.12,0:11:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sen mi yedin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.18,0:12:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tıpkı {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} gibi kokuyorsun!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.03,0:12:02.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.77,0:12:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.29,0:12:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,U... U-Ucuz kurtulduk!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.96,0:12:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ringin dışına çıkarsak\Nöleceğimizi unutmamam lazım!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.54,0:12:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buna daha fazla katlanamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bekle bir saniye!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.11,0:12:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni bi' dinle! Bekle, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.74,0:12:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Big Mom" da kim be?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimden bahsediyorsun?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.20,0:12:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca sen kimsin lan, {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} yiyici?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.90,0:12:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.23,0:12:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni hatırlamıyor musun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.75,0:13:00.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Samuray gibi giyinmişim,\Nbu yüzden tanıyamadın beni!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.24,0:13:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom'ı yemek konusunda kızdırmak büyük bir felaket!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durum kötü. Gerçekten çok kötü.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tasmalar yine ötmeye başladı!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.26,0:13:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu hiç iyi değil.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.68,0:13:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz daha itilirsek öldük demektir.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.52,0:13:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidecek başka yerimiz kalmadı!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.98,0:13:37.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kazan {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} ile dolu olsaydı...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.46,0:13:42.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,onu, şu kasaba halkıyla paylaşabilecektim.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.99,0:13:46.60,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Buyur, biraz {\i1}oshiruko{\i0}. Çekinmeden ye, Olin-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.85,0:13:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(5358,6170,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}O yoksul insanların hepsi\Nbana çok nazik davrandılar.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.23,0:14:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlara biraz {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} götürerek minnettarlığımı göstermek istedim!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.19,0:14:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.43,0:14:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu lezzetli {\i1}oshiruko{\i0}'yu...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.76,0:14:10.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,onlarla paylaşmak istedim!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.37,0:14:13.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya-ya-ya...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.10,0:14:16.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani bu, o meşhur yemek krizlerinden biri değil miymiş?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.86,0:14:19.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu tamamen iyilik için mi yani?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.73,0:14:23.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamen iyi niyetinden dolayı terör estirmiş!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.78,0:14:26.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.83,0:14:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne diye hepsini yedin lan?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.39,0:14:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni boklu velet!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.04,0:14:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.69,0:14:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İhtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çık artık!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.89,0:14:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!\NÖlmene izin vermeyeceğim! Ölemezsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.45,0:14:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çık!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.41,0:14:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çık!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.28,0:15:03.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya kadar mıydı...?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.82,0:15:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çık!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.64,0:15:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çık artık!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.41,0:15:36.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, tasmalar!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.49,0:15:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.16,0:15:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tasmalar gitti!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.79,0:15:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yaptım böyle, ihtiyar?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.41,0:15:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başardım!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.90,0:16:01.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,İnanamıyorum. Gerçekten başardı.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.90,0:16:00.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çıktı be!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.05,0:16:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine elimden sıyrıldın!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.40,0:16:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ, haydi buradan gidelim, ihtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bay Hasır Şapka!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.95,0:16:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O hissi unutmadan...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.48,0:16:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,beni koru!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.81,0:16:20.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne diyorsun be?! Kıpırda, gidelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.48,0:16:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güç, en karanlık anlarda çiçek açar!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.61,0:16:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sefer kurtulamayacaksın!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.82,0:16:28.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Delirdin mi sen?!\NŞimdi mi antrenman yapacağız?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.28,0:16:31.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beceremezsem canından olursun!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.68,0:16:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.75,0:16:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel bakalım, Yonko!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.46,0:16:47.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2608,4090,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Ben de yapabilirim!\NTıpkı Rayleigh'in o zaman yaptığı gibi!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.02,0:17:01.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi tasmanı çıkaracağım.\NBu senin için sorun olur mu, genç hanım?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.79,0:17:06.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalama ihtiyar! Patlayacak!{Sabody 07 - 17:18}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.99,0:17:10.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha önce köle tasmalarından\Nbirinin patladığını gördük!{Sabody 07 - 17:22}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.53,0:17:13.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok kötüydü! Gerçekten kötüydü!{Sabody 07 - 17:25}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.26,0:17:14.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun olmaz mı, Luffy?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.12,0:17:20.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun yok. Sadece sabit dur.{Sabody 07 - 17:29}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.02,0:17:27.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok tehlikeli diyorum sana!\NAnahtar olmadan çıkması imkânsız!{Sabody 07 - 17:47}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.72,0:17:39.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ötmeye başladı! Ne halt edeceğiz şimdi?!{Sabody 07 - 17:56}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.42,0:17:46.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur! Lütfen artık dur!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.90,0:17:53.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Camie!{Sabody 07 - 18:00}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.54,0:18:02.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Tasmayı eliyle mi çıkardı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.38,0:18:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.69,0:18:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç şüphe yok ki\NRayleigh'in o zaman yaptığı da buydu.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.47,0:18:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Az önce ben de yaptım!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.64,0:18:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o kadar çaresizdim ki\Nnasıl yaptığımı hiç hatırlamıyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.81,0:18:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi elimdesin!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.90,0:18:30.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bay Hasır Şapka,\Naz önce ortaya çıkan yeteneğin...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.71,0:18:35.20,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,zaten sana ryuo hakkında öğretebileceklerimin bile ötesinde bir şeydi.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.66,0:18:38.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık onu durdurabilirsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.04,0:18:42.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,O canavar kadının yumruklarını geri püskürt...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.56,0:18:45.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,ve ikimizi de kurtar!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.38,0:18:48.38,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana güvenim tam!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.38,0:18:53.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi bakalım, göster hünerini!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.39,0:18:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölmeye hazır mısın?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her zaman!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.60,0:19:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.49,0:19:03.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yumruğunu karşılamaya mı çalışacak?!\NSaçmalık bu!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.89,0:19:04.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Değil...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.79,0:19:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy bunun altından kalkar, biliyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.59,0:19:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kasmama lüzum yok.\NSadece hakiyi yumruklarıma akıtıyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.86,0:19:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi bakalım!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.17,0:19:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffytaro-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.80,0:19:37.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.14,0:19:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.77,0:19:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne bekliyordun ki?!\N– Ne bekliyordun ki?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.28,0:19:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.53,0:20:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm, ihtiyar! Yine çuvalladım!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.25,0:20:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakın öleyim deme!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.19,0:20:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay, ay, ay!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.42,0:20:14.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misin, ihtiyar?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.30,0:20:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bir nebze Ryuo'yla kendimi korudum...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.14,0:20:21.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İhtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.85,0:20:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ hayattasın, ha?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.31,0:20:31.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle beni...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.40,0:20:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana sadece vücudunu...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.28,0:20:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ryuo ile kaplamayı öğretebilirim...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.62,0:20:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haki dediğiniz şey–
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.16,0:20:45.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, konuşma!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.46,0:20:49.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haki;
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.90,0:20:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hem görünmez bir zırh hem de\Nsaldırı amaçlı kullanılan devasa bir güçtür. {Wano 60 - 21:33}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.88,0:21:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lakin bir üst seviyeye ulaştığında, {Wano 60 - 21:40}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.10,0:21:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seni kaplayan haki daha da güçlenerek... {Wano 60 - 21:44}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.41,0:21:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hasmının içine nüfuz ederek\Nonu içeriden paramparça eder. {Wano 60 - 21:47}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.61,0:21:23.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O çelik tasmaları\Nhakini kullanarak içeriden parçaladın!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.16,0:21:28.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu önceden başardın.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.75,0:21:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İhtiyar...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.00,0:21:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zaten vücudunu haki ile\Nkaplama konusunda ustalaştın.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece henüz farkında değilsin...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.45,0:21:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeteneklerine inan!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.69,0:22:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, ihtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakın öleyim deme, ihtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.11,0:22:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, uyan! İhtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.99,0:22:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölemezsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.66,0:22:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.77,0:22:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İhtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.92,0:22:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne hakla benim ve diğer herkesin hakkı olan {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} mideye indirirsin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.74,0:22:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni asla affetmeyeceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.44,0:22:56.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi şanslar, Bay Hasır Şapka!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.93,0:23:07.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, sinyal yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.72,0:23:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, duyduğum kadarıyla\Naktarıcı salyangoz patronu kaybolmuş.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.39,0:23:12.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.24,0:23:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu gürültü de ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.52,0:23:57.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– B-Big Mom mı?!\N– B-Big Mom mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.98,0:24:01.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.11,0:24:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tutsak demir fabrikasındaki\Ndöküm ocağı infilak etti!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.41,0:24:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapmam gerekiyor?\NNe de olsa, o bir Yonko!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.38,0:24:29.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0} bile ona denk değil.\NBiz nasıl üstesinden gelelim?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.91,0:24:39.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Q-Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.08,0:24:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano, Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}'ın çöplüğüdür.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.27,0:24:45.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kocakarının istediğini\Nyapmasına izin veremeyiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.99,0:24:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.86,0:25:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir fikrim var.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.03,0:25:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek bir şansımız olacak. İyi dinleyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.41,0:25:15.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi bittin, seni boklu velet!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.50,0:25:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlayacağınız, Big Mom vahşi bir yaban domuzundan farksız!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.42,0:25:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon'u dolanıp döne dolaşa yine buraya gelecek.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani, ona güzel bir tuzak hazırlayacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.45,0:25:52.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahrolası!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.36,0:25:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Al sana!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.60,0:26:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}, her şey hazır!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.20,0:26:37.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}, işte geliyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.25,0:26:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hay sokayım! Ne inatçı çıktı be!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.75,0:26:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur diyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.31,0:27:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.69,0:27:09.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.11,0:27:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, işe yaradı!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.99,0:27:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaşasın!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.37,0:27:23.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu boş!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.12,0:27:29.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine mi bitirdin hepsini?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.88,0:27:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni piç!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.38,0:27:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle, bu sefer ben değildim!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.80,0:27:37.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Brachio...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.35,0:27:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Patlaması!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.16,0:28:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşe yaradı! Onu hakladık!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.91,0:28:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaşasın Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.37,0:28:05.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0} yine bildiğimiz gibi!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.37,0:28:07.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun kurtarıcısı o!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.13,0:28:13.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama...!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.92,0:28:15.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.13,0:28:16.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.72,0:28:21.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim sevimli çocuklarım...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.76,0:28:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Kafam acıyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.43,0:28:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyordum ki ben?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.23,0:28:30.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.27,0:28:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka'yı öldürmek için\NWano'ya yol alıyorduk...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.61,0:28:42.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ardından o piç King beni denize tekmeledi.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.45,0:28:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kıyıya sürüklendim,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.25,0:28:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sefil dolu bir kasabaya gittim...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.67,0:28:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve biraz {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} yedim.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.68,0:29:04.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir önder ile uğraşma!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.47,0:29:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hay sokayım, amma uğraştırdın!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.48,0:29:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benimle kafa bulmayı kes, seni gidi kocakarı!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.44,0:29:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.49,0:29:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz. Bu kötü. Çok kötü oldu!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.41,0:29:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun ne, Chopperemon-{\i1}san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.37,0:29:29.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey... Ciddi olamazsın...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.04,0:29:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırımın hiçbir etkisi olmadı mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.54,0:29:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.67,0:29:39.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun adamlarından Queen'sin, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.13,0:29:41.01,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıçtım!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.01,0:29:43.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, hayır, hayır, hayır, hayır, hayır...!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.22,0:29:46.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu canavar öncekinden tamamen farklı görünüyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.10,0:29:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her neyse, duyduğum kadarıyla...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.85,0:29:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,elinizde biraz {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} varmış, doğru mu?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.02,0:29:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Verin bana gitsin.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.65,0:30:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}... {\i1}Oshiruko{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.87,0:30:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nesi var bunun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.29,0:30:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen bana {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} verin!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.00,0:30:19.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hapı yuttum!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:38.23,0:30:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:40.07,0:30:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Derhal bana %100 saf deniz taşından yapılma kelepçelerle zincirler getirin!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.16,0:30:46.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele edin!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:46.82,0:30:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Başüstüne!\N– Başüstüne!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.62,0:30:54.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şunları ona tam 100 kez dolayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.12,0:30:55.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Başüstüne!\N– Başüstüne!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:01.30,0:31:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır, efendim!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.72,0:31:03.80,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.80,0:31:08.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yeterli değil! Daha fazlası gerek!\NKendimi hâlâ güvende hissetmiyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.47,0:31:10.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha fazlasını yapmalıyız!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.43,0:31:13.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona tam 100 tane vahşi hayvan sakinleştiricisi vurun!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.43,0:31:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Başüstüne!\N– Başüstüne!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.19,0:31:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır! Gemi yolculuğa hazır mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.23,0:31:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, efendim! Hazır!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:22.28,0:31:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada sadece çok az kişi kalsın,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:26.20,0:31:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,geri kalan herkes gemiye doluşsun!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:28.24,0:31:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babanuki, Udon'u tamamen senin sorumluluğuna bırakıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.20,0:31:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Başüstüne!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.70,0:31:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kocakarı Udon'daki bütün kapıları kırdı!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:37.79,0:31:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben gidince acil durum kapılarıyla Udon'u mühürleyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:43.01,0:31:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mahkûmları hücrelerine atın\Nve burayı kontrol altına alın!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.97,0:31:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana bırakın! Ancak–
Dialogue: 50,0:31:49.26,0:31:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.68,0:31:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada zamanla yarışıyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.60,0:31:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kocakarıyı Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}'a götürmeliyiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:59.86,0:32:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele edin!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.57,0:32:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yelken açın!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.62,0:32:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yelkenler fora! Hedefimiz Onigashima!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.92,0:32:22.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo-{\i1}kun{\i0}, kapılar kapanıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:22.59,0:32:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapabileceğimiz hiçbir şey yok.\NBurada bekleyeceğimize söz verdik.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.47,0:32:29.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diğerlerine güvenmeli ve sabırla beklemeliyiz.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.26,0:32:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi gidelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.35,0:32:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bütün kapılar mühürlendi mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:34.06,0:32:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, efendim!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.27,0:32:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İletişimi tekrar açtık mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:37.02,0:32:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır... henüz değil, efendim!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.23,0:32:42.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon hâlâ tamamen izole durumda!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:42.69,0:32:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon dışında herhangi bir yerle\Niletişim kuramıyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.53,0:32:46.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:47.95,0:32:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Madem öyle, artık tozu dumana katabilirim.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.91,0:32:58.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom ve o balonla kapışmak harika olurdu...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.29,0:33:01.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama neyse, şimdi antrenman zamanı!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:01.83,0:33:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru ya. Şu serseri artık özgürdü.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:08.17,0:33:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...
Dialogue: 50,0:33:10.22,0:33:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,her zaman özgürdüm ki!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.14,0:33:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mahkûmlar şanslarını fazla zorlamamaları gerektiğini bilmeli.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:17.02,0:33:19.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haberin olsun...
Dialogue: 50,0:33:19.02,0:33:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon artık benim!
